  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. Cook spaghetti in boiling water, over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 10 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65d6dc66bb774993318afdce-7294cd09.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook mushrooms until browned and softened, 6-8 mins.\n• Add herby tomato seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65d6dc66bb774993318afdce-671c7906.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in passata, the brown sugar, butter and the reserved pasta water and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Add cooked spaghetti and baby spinach, tossing until combined. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65d6dc66bb774993318afdce-30a00174.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide herby tomato and mushroom spaghetti between bowls. Top with a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65d6dc66bb774993318afdce-75c3b7ca.jpeg"
    }
  ]
